Add shipping tracking information to your orders.

== Description ==
AS Order Tracking is a WordPress plugin that manage information for shipping your orders and that lets your customers be notified about their order shipping.

= Features =

* Automatically change orders status to completed .
* Can add shipping information in your email completing.

== Installation ==

Manual Installation

1. Upload the entire `/as-order-tracking` directory to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory.
2. Activate AS Order Tracking through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress.

